, ačiū!","Gal galėtum kalbėti lėčiau?","Be abejo. Pasakysiu lėtai.","Žinoma! Ką reikia daryti?","Ką tai reiškia?","Žiūrėk, paaiškinsiu.","Būtų puiku, ačiū!","Labai ačiū!","Nėra už ką!","Taip, prašau.","Gal galėtum pakartoti?","Atsiprašau, gal galėtum pakartoti?","Atsiprašau, neišgirdau.","Ačiū už pagalbą!","Mielai!","Geras klausimas! Tuoj parodysiu.","Žinoma, kalbėsiu lėčiau.","Nėra už ką!"],"turns":[[0,"¡Hola! ¿Me ayudas con algo?","Hi! Can you help me with something?","79a573befee1",1.85],[0,"Estoy haciendo un álbum de fotos de Puerto Colibrí para mi abuela.","I'm making a photo album of Puerto Colibrí for my grandma.","3c06da756400",2.86],[0,"Tengo una lista de doce cosas, ¡pero ya me duelen los pies!","I have a list of twelve things, but my feet already hurt!","140a82bf6180",3.66],[0,"¿Me ayudas a tomar las fotos?","Can you help me take the photos?","d5e513221cef",1.53],[-1,"¡Claro, con gusto!","Sure, I'd be glad to!",1],[0,"¡Ay, gracias! Aquí está mi lista.","Oh, thank you! Here's my list.","084e7d786f51",2.13],[0,"Busca cada cosa, tómale una foto y dime qué es.","Find each thing, take a photo of it and tell me what it is.","91648f02ff68",3.44],[0,"¡Que te diviertas!","Have fun!","0c96d69b2ba2",1.34],[0,"¡Hola otra vez! ¿Ya tienes tiempo para mi álbum?","Hi again! Do you have time for my album now?","e26c7b2899d3",2.43],[-1,"Perdón, no entiendo.","Sorry, I don't understand.",1],[0,"No hay problema. Lo repito más despacio.","No problem. I'll say it again, more slowly.","35cce470981b",2.42],[-1,"¡Claro, gracias!","Sure, thanks!",1],[-1,"¿Puedes hablar más despacio, por favor?","Could you speak more slowly, please?",1],[0,"Por supuesto. Lo digo despacio.","Of course. I'll say it slowly.","a451326116fc",2.38],[-1,"¡Claro! ¿Qué tengo que hacer?","Sure! What do I have to do?",1],[-1,"¿Qué significa eso?","What does that mean?",1],[0,"Mira, te explico.","Here, let me explain.","ba95e244e66c",1.18],[-1,"¡Sería genial, gracias!","That would be great, thanks!",1],[-1,"¡Muchas gracias!","Thank you very much!",1],[0,"¡De nada!","You're welcome!","e4777a8dff7e",1.12],[-1,"Sí, por favor.","Yes, please.",1],[-1,"¿Me lo repites, por favor?","Could you repeat that, please?",1],[-1,"Perdón, ¿puedes repetir?","Sorry, could you say that again?",1],[-1,"Perdón, no escuché bien.","Sorry, I didn't catch that.",1],[-1,"¡Gracias por tu ayuda!","Thanks for your help!",1],[0,"¡Con gusto!","My pleasure!","0180c2f4235f",1.24],[0,"¡Buena pregunta! Déjame mostrarte.","Good question! Let me show you.","7acea822e170",2.34],[0,"Claro, te hablo más despacio.","Sure, I'll speak more slowly.","bc6faa8d4e9e",1.99],[0,"¡No hay de qué!","Don't mention it!","3a1f8e83e3d3",0.7]],"contexts":[{"sim":0,"visits":0,"seed":1},{"visits":1,"seed":1},{"visits":0,"seed":1},{"visits":1,"seed":2}],"replies":["help/0","g_clarify/4","g_yesno/2","g_clarify/2","help/1","g_clarify/6","g_yesno/4","g_social/0","g_yesno/0","g_clarify/1","g_clarify/0","g_clarify/3","g_social/1"],"paths":[[0,0],[1,1,2],[2,3,4],[2,5,6],[2,7,8],[1,9,2],[1,10,0],[1,11,4],[1,12,0],[2,5,4],[2,3,8],[2,1,2],[2,12,6],[1,12,4],[1,3,2],[2,1,4],[1,5,0],[2,3,6],[1,7,2],[1,12,8],[3,9,0],[3,9,4],[2,3,0],[1,0],[1,3,0],[2,7,2],[2,3,2],[1,12,6],[2,12,0],[1,5,4],[2,9,8],[2,5,2],[1,7,0],[1,1,0],[2,9,0]],"shortHappyPath":[0,0]}
